N\left(\overrightarrow{x},\overrightarrow{w}\right)=\sum_{i=1}^{K}w_{(d+2)i-(d+1)}\sigma\left(\sum_{j=1}^{d}x_{j}w_{(d+2)i-(d+1)+j}+w_{(d+2)i}\right)
